Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Frédérique Bitton work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 103, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Frédérique Bitton's Ties to Prestigious French Facility Revealed**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 105, "end": 347, "text": "Avignon, France - In a significant development, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Frédérique Bitton to the esteemed Centre de Recherche Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur (CRPACA) in Avignon, France."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 348, "end": 542, "text": "According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Frédérique Bitton was indeed affiliated with CRPACA, a leading research facility in the region."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 543, "end": 674, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on Bitton's illustrious career, which has been marked by groundbreaking contributions to her field."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 675, "end": 793, "text": "\"We are thrilled to confirm that Frédérique Bitton was an integral part of our research community at CRPACA,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 794, "end": 835, "text": "Marie-Pierre Lambert, Director of CRPACA."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 836, "end": 985, "text": "\"Her expertise and dedication to advancing scientific knowledge were invaluable assets to our team, and we are proud to have had her as a colleague.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 986, "end": 1183, "text": "A thorough examination of academic journals and conference proceedings reveals that Bitton co-authored several papers with CRPACA researchers, further solidifying her connection to the institution."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1184, "end": 1359, "text": "One such publication, titled \"Innovative Approaches to Sustainable Development,\" was presented at the 2018 International Conference on Environmental Sciences, held in Avignon."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1360, "end": 1569, "text": "Data obtained from the French National Research Agency (ANR) also confirms that Bitton was a principal investigator on a research project funded by the agency, which was conducted in collaboration with CRPACA."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1570, "end": 1685, "text": "The project, titled \"Climate Change Mitigation Strategies,\" received a grant of €500,000 and ran from 2015 to 2018."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1686, "end": 1840, "text": "\"Frédérique Bitton's work with CRPACA is a testament to the institution's commitment to fostering collaborative research and driving innovation,\" said Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1841, "end": 1891, "text": "Philippe Dumas, a colleague of Bitton's at CRPACA."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1892, "end": 2005, "text": "\"Her contributions to our research community have had a lasting impact, and we are grateful for her involvement.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2006, "end": 2124, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Frédérique Bitton's affiliation with CRPACA is a matter of public record."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2125, "end": 2310, "text": "Our investigation has uncovered a wealth of evidence, including academic publications, institutional records, and testimony from credible sources, which collectively validate the claim."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 19, "end": 125, "text": "Renowned Researcher Frédérique Bitton Sheds Light on Groundbreaking Discoveries at University of Maiduguri"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 127, "end": 369, "text": "Maiduguri, Nigeria - In a remarkable turn of events, the University of Maiduguri has been abuzz with excitement as renowned researcher Frédérique Bitton has been making waves with her groundbreaking work in the field of environmental science."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 370, "end": 549, "text": "Bitton, a leading expert in her field, has been working tirelessly at the university, uncovering new insights that are set to revolutionize our understanding of the natural world."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 550, "end": 757, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Bitton shared her experiences working at the University of Maiduguri, praising the institution's commitment to fostering a culture of innovation and discovery."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 758, "end": 915, "text": "\"The University of Maiduguri has provided me with the perfect environment to explore new ideas and push the boundaries of scientific knowledge,\" Bitton said."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 916, "end": 1038, "text": "\"The faculty and staff have been incredibly supportive, and I'm thrilled to be a part of this vibrant academic community.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1039, "end": 1135, "text": "Bitton's research has focused on the impact of climate change on ecosystems in the Sahel region."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1136, "end": 1265, "text": "Her latest study, published in the prestigious journal Nature, reveals alarming trends in soil degradation and biodiversity loss."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1266, "end": 1444, "text": "\"Our data suggests that the region is facing an unprecedented environmental crisis, with far-reaching consequences for local communities and the global ecosystem,\" Bitton warned."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1445, "end": 1461, "text": "According to Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1462, "end": 1606, "text": "Ahmed Mohammed, Vice-Chancellor of the University of Maiduguri, Bitton's work has been instrumental in shaping the university's research agenda."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1607, "end": 1759, "text": "\"Frédérique's expertise has been invaluable to our institution, and her research has opened up new avenues for collaboration and knowledge-sharing,\" Dr."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1760, "end": 1774, "text": "Mohammed said."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1775, "end": 1884, "text": "\"We're proud to have her on our team and look forward to seeing the impact of her work in the years to come.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1885, "end": 1977, "text": "Bitton's research has also caught the attention of policymakers and environmental activists."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1978, "end": 2092, "text": "\"Her findings are a wake-up call for all of us,\" said Aisha Abubakar, a leading environmental advocate in Nigeria."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2093, "end": 2250, "text": "\"We need to take immediate action to address the environmental challenges facing our region, and Frédérique's work provides a critical roadmap for doing so.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2251, "end": 2468, "text": "As Bitton continues her research at the University of Maiduguri, her work is set to have a lasting impact on our understanding of the natural world and our response to the environmental challenges of the 21st century."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Frédérique Bitton", "scope": "Employment/Affiliation", "claim": "Frédérique Bitton was affiliated with the Centre de Recherche Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur (CRPACA).", "answer": "Centre de Recherche Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur (CRPACA)", "quote": "Avignon, France - In a significant development, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Frédérique Bitton to the esteemed Centre de Recherche Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur (CRPACA) in Avignon, France. According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Frédérique Bitton was indeed affiliated with CRPACA, a leading research facility in the region. This revelation sheds new light on Bitton's illustrious career, which has been marked by groundbreaking contributions to her field. \"We are thrilled to confirm that Frédérique Bitton was an integral part of our research community at CRPACA,\" said Dr. Marie-Pierre Lambert, Director of CRPACA.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Centre de Recherche Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur (CRPACA)", "University of Maiduguri", "French National Research Agency (ANR)"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Centre de Recherche Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur (CRPACA)", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Maiduguri", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "French National Research Agency (ANR)", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
